# Strings that stay in English in every catalog, on purpose.
#
# One per line; "#" starts a comment. A line matches a reported string when it
# is identical to it or a prefix, so "Camera" would also cover "Camera mode".
# tools/check-client-overflow.sh fails on any untranslated *prose* that is not
# listed here, because the catalogs are meant to be complete rather than
# mostly complete. Keep this list short and justify each line.
#
# OpenGL sampling keywords: these are the values the driver expects, not text.
linear_mipmap_linear
# cairo's own version banner, which the settings About row prints verbatim.
ImageMagick
